  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1402.03 “Direct supervision” means supervision by a supervisor who is present and observing the activity of the individual being supervised.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442 (formerly Plc 1402.07), eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
